  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Folke Bernadotte Academy will conduct a feasibility study in Ukraine. The aim of the study is to explore options for a viable and           sustainable project set-up and to identify effective modalities for a project prior to submitting a project proposal on Rule of Law in      Public Administration at the Local Government Level in Ukraine.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin ska genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie i Ukraina. Syftet med denna studie &#xe4;r att utforska m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r ett genomf&#xf6;rbart och h&#xe5;llbart projektformat samt att identifiera effektiva former f&#xf6;r      projektimplementeringen innan FBA l&#xe4;mnar in projektf&#xf6;rslag till       R&#xe4;ttsstatsprincipen i offentlig f&#xf6;rvaltning p&#xe5; lokal f&#xf6;rvaltningsniv&#xe5; i Ukraina.</narrative>
  </description>
